# Altitutor Monorepo

pnpm Turborepo. Web apps: `*-web` (admin/student/tutor/marketing/ucat). Expo apps: `*-app` (e.g. `student-app`). Packages: `shared`, `ui`, `ucat-marking`.

## Feature-first

Colocate under `features/[name]/`: `api/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `types/`, `mappers/`, `index.ts`.

- Keep business logic out of UI (hooks, utils, API layer)
- Prefer focused components; avoid god files
- Naming: components/types `PascalCase`; hooks/utils `camelCase`; constants `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` in `constants.ts`
- Do not create unsolicited `.md` docs
